{
  "id": "40",
  "title": "滚浪桃花",
  "guide": "本篇讨论“滚浪桃花”相关旧法。阅读时先提取月令、日主、透藏、制化与岁运等条件，再与其他章节交叉核对，不直接套用结果性断语。",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女命用官为夫、或杀；只喜一位，多者剋夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-888970727b4d7714552e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "如命满盘官星为忌；满柱杀星，为福反吉。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-4c1019eca71a0c599ead-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官不为贵，伤官运复行剋夫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-83ce828ec01089d205fe-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官有制身绝。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-fa50ac2eb57e561371a9-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女命伤官，刑子、剋夫为决。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-3d488ff1b4ad2db34f78-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "女命官星多者，伤夫主贱。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-9df7643b8118ad829bd6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "伤官桃花，为妓女命，或主剋子息。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-13ed1c9b4c4b927c34d6-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "若见贵人一位，或带荣神、或犯绝地，多富贵贞洁。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-ac1f80b16927d5ce5500-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "禄马相随，桃花带贵，咸池遇马，多淫、妨夫破家。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-b60874c6d61da4ea45b7-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "有辰无戌命孤，晚景寂寞。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-5e302cb3bf7cecfe4d8e-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "戌多无辰，初年劳碌，中年好；不妨夫、不剋子，风流而淫。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-323de678e845eadeccb0-0",
      "translation": null
    },
    {
      "heading": "",
      "original": "辰戌全则淫乱破家、伤夫剋子、夭寿残疾。",
      "commentary": "",
      "id": "40-099a4cdac88f8b666277-0",
      "translation": null
    }
  ],
  "editionId": "yuanhai-6fbd3c1c68ee5326ccef",
  "version": "ca513874fd5e3ef7467b"
}
